<table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 21, 2003 :: 10th Ring War!</div><P>My scheduled plans fell through since the critters I wanted to kill weren't up. After tracking and finding more suitable things to kill not up, and things that were up weren't really needed, Mahrsan suggested we check on the trigger for the war for his ring. Yes, it's been a small obsession with him for some time. Well, the little guy was up, so we headed to GD and Mahrsan led us against the giants. True, there was no speech given with him pacing back and forth first, which I think will be required by anyone leading this in the future. Regardless of being jipped out of our victory speech, we slaughtered the giants and saved all but one of the heroes. </P>
<P>Everyone did a great job, working together to stop giants who were determined to get to Thurgadin. Very few made it to the bard squad of Myschief, Aridius, Lushissx and Greylok&nbsp;(with Mahrsan and Garacaius), just that one wave which was sent back and killed. Thanks to our chanter duo, Zavitar and Tryder,&nbsp;for buffing while also keeping the giants dead or away! Our rangers watched track and kept us informed; thanks Beryllin, Antroe and Lairiel! Thanks Aridius for being the sacrificial lamb and kiting Narandi around while we buffed up and made sure the healers and nukers were FM. Thanks Lush for following around Aridius in case Narandi got his way with him (he didn't)! Basically, too many people to thank! Everyone did their job and stepped up to stop runners, keep each other alive, and have fun doing it. Oh, and Morlith died! Really, it's no longer a raid until we hear the cry of "Morlith down!"</P>
<P>Grats Mahrsan on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/ring_dain_frostweaver.jpg">Ring of Dain Frostreaver IV</A>, Ckaii on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/crown_of_narandi.jpg">Crown of Narandi</A>, Sythmillions on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/Choker_of_the_Wretched.jpg">Choker of the Wretched</A>, Cassana on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/faceguard_bentos_hero.jpg">Faceguard of Bentos the Hero</A>, Sonaddor on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/narandis_lance.jpg">Narandi's Lance</A> and Grace on the GREED roll for <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/earringfrozenskull.jpg">Earring of the Frozen Skull</A>. </P>
